      "seq": 485,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps - Ability triggers: Leyline Binding - When Leyline Binding enters, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Leyline Binding leaves the battlefield. -  targeting Ugin, Eye of the Storms",
