      "seq": 491,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps - Ability triggers: Thundering Falls - When Thundering Falls enters, surveil 1.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:27:27.105466205-08:00",
      "seq": 492,
      "message": "Layin&#39; down another falls to surveil the future&mdash;back in my day, we didn&#39;t need all these tri-lands, but they&#39;ll do for scoutin&#39; the path to victory, whippersnapper!",
