      "message": "Grok4F Gramps surveils 1 (source: Thundering Falls)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:27:48.934670831-08:00",
      "seq": 495,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps puts a card from library to the top of their library (source: Thundering Falls)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:27:48.93865161-08:00",
      "seq": 496,
      "message": "Peekin&#39; at the future, seein&#39; a Solitude&mdash;nah, I ain&#39;t buryin&#39; that ol&#39; faithful just yet. Back to the bottom with ye, ready for the draw later!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:28:33.523840266-08:00",
      "seq": 498,
      "message": "Prismatic Ending on that Eldrazi Temple&mdash;newfangled mana rocks, but nothin&#39; a good ol&#39; converge can&#39;t handle. Three colors oughta do it, back to basics!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:28:42.876342564-08:00",
      "seq": 499,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps announces a value of 2 for {X} (source: Prismatic Ending)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:28:42.877132788-08:00",
      "seq": 500,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps casts Prismatic Ending targeting Talisman of Impulse from hand",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:28:42.877992855-08:00",
      "seq": 501,
      "message": "Zappin&#39; that Talisman with a Prismatic Ending&mdash;fancy mana trinkets won&#39;t save ye now, whippersnapper! Back in my day, we smashed artifacts with the classics!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:29:32.234817067-08:00",
      "seq": 502,
      "message": "Escapin&#39; ol&#39; Phlage from the grave&mdash;back in my day, we called this recursion, none o&#39; yer fancy escape mechanics! Burn the player for 3, and let&#39;s see ye squirm, whippersnapper!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:29:44.870356016-08:00",
      "seq": 503,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps moves Talisman of Impulse from battlefield to the exile zone (source: Prismatic Ending)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:29:44.871360989-08:00",
      "seq": 504,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps puts Prismatic Ending from stack into their graveyard",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:30:15.028872437-08:00",
      "seq": 506,
      "message": "A little ping from Wrenn to ye, whippersnapper&mdash;back in my day, we whittled down life totals one honest damage at a time, no need for yer big stompy nonsense!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:30:35.396444082-08:00",
      "seq": 508,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps skip attack",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:30:35.407298652-08:00",
      "seq": 510,
      "message": "Passin&#39; here&mdash;ye&#39;ve got that board locked down, but wait &#39;til combat, young whippersnapper. Back in my day, we let the creatures do the talkin&#39;!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:30:41.221167736-08:00",
      "seq": 514,
      "message": "TURN 17 for GLM47 Coach (13 - 17)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:30:41.222031641-08:00",
      "seq": 516,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach draws a card",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:30:53.49106815-08:00",
      "seq": 520,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach skip attack",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:31:11.281022624-08:00",
      "seq": 524,
      "message": "Huddle up, team! They took out Ugin with Leyline Binding - tough break! But look what we&#39;ve got in our playbook! EMRAKUL! And with 5 card types in our graveyard, she only costs 8! Let&#39;s show them what REAL power looks like!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "GLM47 Coach",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:31:16.375375224-08:00",
      "seq": 526,
      "message": "TURN 18 for Grok4F Gramps (13 - 17)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:31:16.385793273-08:00",
      "seq": 528,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps draws a card",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:31:25.360477737-08:00",
      "seq": 531,
      "message": "A quick -1 from Wrenn to chip away at yer lifetotal, whippersnapper&mdash;back in my day, planeswalkers like her did the job without all this loyalty fuss!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:31:39.952546609-08:00",
      "seq": 532,
      "message": "Phlage roars in, burnin&#39; ye for 3&mdash;take that heat, young whippersnapper! Back in my day, titans like this settled scores without all the fancy escapes!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:32:15.078932915-08:00",
      "seq": 533,
      "message": "Burnin&#39; ye direct, whippersnapper&mdash;3 to the dome, just like the good ol&#39; direct damage spells back in the day! No fancy blockers for that!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
