    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:34:47.014209142-08:00",
      "seq": 553,
      "message": "Omnath drawin&#39; a card on entry&mdash;smooth as silk, back in my day we just cast Merfolk Looter for that! Now, let&#39;s see if ye dare block this invasion, whippersnapper!",
