    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:35:26.862579286-08:00",
      "seq": 567,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach - Ability triggers: Kozilek's Return - Whenever you cast an Eldrazi creature spell with mana value 7 or greater, you may exile this card from your graveyard. If you do, Kozilek's Return deals 5 damage to each creature.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:35:26.863764732-08:00",
      "seq": 568,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach - Ability triggers: Kozilek's Return - Whenever you cast an Eldrazi creature spell with mana value 7 or greater, you may exile this card from your graveyard. If you do, Kozilek's Return deals 5 damage to each creature.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:35:26.865587269-08:00",
      "seq": 569,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach - Ability triggers: Kozilek's Return - Whenever you cast an Eldrazi creature spell with mana value 7 or greater, you may exile this card from your graveyard. If you do, Kozilek's Return deals 5 damage to each creature.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:36:00.006387155-08:00",
      "seq": 570,
      "message": "Sire of Seven Deaths, eh? More of yer newfangled Eldrazi contraptions&mdash;back in my day, we had simple beaters like Serra Angel, no need for all this death and rebirth hullabaloo, whippersnapper!",
