    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:37:51.061326206-08:00",
      "seq": 586,
      "message": "TOUCHDOWN! Kozilek&#39;s Return wipes their board - all their creatures gone! And our Sire of Seven Deaths stands tall at 7/7! That&#39;s textbook execution, team! Now let&#39;s drop that Ghost Quarter and keep building!",
