      "message": "Grok4F Gramps casts Wrenn and Six from hand",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:39:00.800801846-08:00",
      "seq": 600,
      "message": "Castin&#39; another Wrenn and Six&mdash;two of &#39;em now, just like the old dual lands we trusted! None of this Eldrazi ward nonsense back then, whippersnapper. We&#39;ll whittle ye down proper!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:40:03.917342656-08:00",
      "seq": 601,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps puts Wrenn and Six from stack onto the Battlefield",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:40:09.624513668-08:00",
      "seq": 603,
      "message": "Wrenn and Six is put into graveyard from battlefield",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:40:09.688705074-08:00",
      "seq": 604,
      "message": "Ah, the legendary rule strikin&#39; again&mdash;back in my day, we didn&#39;t have these planeswalker duplicates causin&#39; fuss! Keepin&#39; the old Wrenn with more tricks up her sleeve, whippersnapper.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:40:52.013284388-08:00",
      "seq": 606,
      "message": "Escapin&#39; Phlage from the grave once more&mdash;{R}{R}{W}{W} worth of fury, burnin&#39; ye for 3 straight to the face! Back in my day, we had Fireball for that, none of this titan nonsense, but it&#39;ll do, whippersnapper! Me life up to 16, yers down to 14!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:41:47.255321329-08:00",
      "seq": 607,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps moves Delighted Halfling from graveyard to the exile zone (source: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury)",
