    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:41:47.258632778-08:00",
      "seq": 611,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps moves Solitude from graveyard to the exile zone (source: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:41:47.25930701-08:00",
      "seq": 612,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps casts Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury with Escape from graveyard from graveyard",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:41:58.389427351-08:00",
      "seq": 613,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps puts Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury from stack onto the Battlefield",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:41:58.404797349-08:00",
      "seq": 615,
      "message": "Phlage burstin&#39; forth from the grave, scorchin&#39; ye for 3&mdash;life&#39;s a fickle thing, whippersnapper. Back in my day, we&#39;d just Lightning Bolt the fool, but this escapin&#39; titan&#39;ll have to suffice. Stack clearin&#39; now!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:42:12.051664474-08:00",
      "seq": 616,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps - Ability triggers: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury - When Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury enters, sacrifice it unless it escaped.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:42:44.520726779-08:00",
      "seq": 617,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps - Ability triggers: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury - Whenever Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury enters or attacks, it deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life. -  targeting GLM47 Coach",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:42:57.024126526-08:00",
      "seq": 618,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach loses 3 life from Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:42:57.024685329-08:00",
      "seq": 619,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps gains 3 life (source: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:42:57.040244676-08:00",
      "seq": 621,
      "message": "Phlage&#39;s fury hittin&#39; ye square, 3 damage to the dome&mdash;yer at 14 now, and I&#39;m plump at 16! Back in my day, we&#39;d call that a solid Shock, whippersnapper. Let&#39;s see ye squirm!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:43:07.522089754-08:00",
      "seq": 623,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps skip attack",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:43:31.629402799-08:00",
      "seq": 627,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach activates: return the exiled card to its owner's hand. from Ugin's Labyrinth",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:43:51.424579441-08:00",
      "seq": 629,
      "message": "TURN 21 for GLM47 Coach (16 - 14)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:43:51.436382713-08:00",
      "seq": 631,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach draws a card",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:43:55.602248052-08:00",
      "seq": 634,
      "message": "No more tricks from the grave this turn, eh? Yer Eldrazi pup&#39;s sittin&#39; there all innocent-like, but back in my day, a 7/7 with all them keywords would&#39;ve been the whole deck! Don&#39;t get comfy, whippersnapper&mdash;me Phlage is itchin&#39; to smash.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:44:10.047047163-08:00",
      "seq": 637,
      "message": "Team huddle! Look at this - Ugin&#39;s back in our playbook from the Labyrinth! And we&#39;ve got exactly 7 mana to cast him! This is our MVP moment - Ugin exiles a permanent on entry AND gives us card advantage! Let&#39;s make the play!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "GLM47 Coach",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:44:12.229041868-08:00",
      "seq": 638,
      "message": "Yer turn again, whippersnapper&mdash;Sire lookin&#39; mighty with all them fancy keywords, but back in my day a Serra Angel did the job without the ward tax! Don&#39;t think me Phlage won&#39;t come swingin&#39; if ye get bold.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:44:38.598080386-08:00",
      "seq": 640,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach attacks Grok4F Gramps with 1 creature",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:44:52.594898884-08:00",
      "seq": 641,
      "message": "Ah, sendin&#39; that big ol&#39; Sire swingin&#39;&mdash;menace and all, but back in my day, we&#39;d just block with a humble Grizzly Bears and call it a day! Takin&#39; the hit stoically, whippersnapper, like we did uphill both ways.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:00.09534928-08:00",
      "seq": 643,
      "message": "Attacker: Sire of Seven Deaths (7/7) unblocked",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:00.165428601-08:00",
      "seq": 644,
      "message": "Can&#39;t block that menace beast with what I&#39;ve got&mdash;takin&#39; the 7 like a true veteran, down to 9 life now. Yer Sire&#39;s a fine specimen, but back in my day, we&#39;d pay no ward and just swing away! Keep pushin&#39;, whippersnapper.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:28.362875593-08:00",
      "seq": 645,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps loses 7 life at combat from Sire of Seven Deaths",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:28.363645166-08:00",
      "seq": 646,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach gains 7 life",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:28.469145502-08:00",
      "seq": 652,
      "message": "TURN 22 for Grok4F Gramps (9 - 21)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:28.470606602-08:00",
      "seq": 654,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps draws a card",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:28.583433925-08:00",
      "seq": 657,
      "message": "Takin&#39; that 7 damage like a champ&mdash;down to 9, but I&#39;ve weathered worse storms in the old paper tournaments, whippersnapper. Yer Ugin&#39;s a sight, exilin&#39; me goods, but back in my day, we didn&#39;t need eyes of storms, just a good Wrath of God! Yer turn windin&#39; down?",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:46.3245296-08:00",
      "seq": 661,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps attacks GLM47 Coach with 1 creature",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:46.330233169-08:00",
      "seq": 662,
      "message": "Sendin&#39; Phlage in for a fiery charge&mdash;6 power comin&#39; at ye, and that trigger burnin&#39; for 3 more! Back in my day, we&#39;d just alpha strike with Llanowar Elves, but this titan&#39;s got fury. Let&#39;s see if yer Sire pays the ward or swings back, whippersnapper!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:45:58.668108967-08:00",
      "seq": 663,
      "message": "Phlage charglin&#39; in, trigger ready to singe&mdash;back in my day, attacks were straightforward without these escape antics! Who&#39;s feelin&#39; the burn, whippersnapper?",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:01.962348886-08:00",
      "seq": 664,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps - Ability triggers: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury - Whenever Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury enters or attacks, it deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life. -  targeting GLM47 Coach",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:01.964257597-08:00",
      "seq": 665,
      "message": "Phlage&#39;s fury targets ye direct, 3 damage scorched to the dome&mdash;yer down to 18, me up to 12! Back in my day, we&#39;d just Incinerate for the win, whippersnapper. Block if ye dare with that warded beast!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:16.786033005-08:00",
      "seq": 666,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach loses 3 life from Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:16.786588302-08:00",
      "seq": 667,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps gains 3 life (source: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:16.862684044-08:00",
      "seq": 669,
      "message": "Resolvin&#39; that Phlage trigger&mdash;3 more to ye, and 3 life for the old-timer. Back in my day, we&#39;d just pass and let the burn fly, none of this fancy blockin&#39; nonsense yet. Yer move, whippersnapper!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:52.795800999-08:00",
      "seq": 671,
      "message": "Alright team, Phlage hits us for 6 and burns for 3 - we&#39;re at 18, they&#39;re at 12! But look at this playbook - we&#39;ve got Wooded Foothills to grab another land, then Icetill Explorer to ramp us up! Extra lands per turn AND lands from graveyard? That&#39;s championship strategy!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "GLM47 Coach",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:46:54.384747323-08:00",
      "seq": 672,
      "message": "Passin&#39; priority before the clash&mdash;yer Sire&#39;s got that first strike edge, but back in my day, we&#39;d block with a Wall of Swords and laugh it off! Let&#39;s see if ye trade or let the titan through, whippersnapper.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:04.948629892-08:00",
      "seq": 674,
      "message": "Attacker: Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury (6/6) blocked by Sire of Seven Deaths (7/7)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:12.440648285-08:00",
      "seq": 675,
      "message": "Sire of Seven Deaths deals 7 damage to Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:12.441358354-08:00",
      "seq": 676,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach gains 7 life",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:12.443415541-08:00",
      "seq": 678,
      "message": "Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury died",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:12.44463021-08:00",
      "seq": 679,
      "message": "Sire blockin&#39; the titan&mdash;first strike gonna whack me Phlage for 7, and ye gain that lifelink too, up to 25 now? Back in my day, no ward or lifelink overloads; just plain ol&#39; creatures clashin&#39;. Takin&#39; the trade like the old warrior I am, whippersnapper!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:38.026895761-08:00",
      "seq": 683,
      "message": "Sire&#39;s first strike fells me Phlage&mdash;tradin&#39; down with that warded behemoth, gains ye 7 life to 25, me hangin&#39; at 9. Back in my day, no lifelink spam; we&#39;d just lose the creature and move on, uphill both ways. Yer a tough nut, whippersnapper, but the old man&#39;s not done yet!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:47:57.167818279-08:00",
      "seq": 685,
      "message": "Callin&#39; out the Delighted Halfling to lend a hand&mdash;back in my day, we didn&#39;t need special mana for legendaries, but this little one&#39;s got spirit! Helpin&#39; ramp the old way, whippersnapper.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F Gramps",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:48:19.006729099-08:00",
      "seq": 686,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps has lost the game.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:48:19.007072186-08:00",
      "seq": 687,
      "message": "GLM47 Coach has won the game",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:48:19.007174259-08:00",
      "seq": 688,
      "message": "Grok4F Gramps has run out of time, losing the match.",
    },
