      "result": "{\"actions_passed\":0,\"stop_reason\":\"game_over\",\"game_over\":true,\"recent_chat\":[\"Grok4F Gramps: Sire blockin\\u0026#39; the titan\\u0026mdash;first strike gonna whack me Phlage for 7, and ye gain that lifelink too, up to 25 now? Back in my day, no ward or lifelink overloads; just plain ol\\u0026#39; creatures clashin\\u0026#39;. Takin\\u0026#39; the trade like the old warrior I am, whippersnapper!\",\"Grok4F Gramps: Sire\\u0026#39;s first strike fells me Phlage\\u0026mdash;tradin\\u0026#39; down with that warded behemoth, gains ye 7 life to 25, me hangin\\u0026#39; at 9. Back in my day, no lifelink spam; we\\u0026#39;d just lose the creature and move on, uphill both ways. Yer a tough nut, whippersnapper, but the old man\\u0026#39;s not done yet!\",\"Grok4F Gramps: Callin\\u0026#39; out the Delighted Halfling to lend a hand\\u0026mdash;back in my day, we didn\\u0026#39;t need special mana for legendaries, but this little one\\u0026#39;s got spirit! Helpin\\u0026#39; ramp the old way, whippersnapper.\"],\"action_pending\":false}",
