    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cracking Arid Mesa before casting Wrenn and Six means losing a potential landfall trigger for Omnath next turn. Wrenn's +1 could recur a fetchland from graveyard, giving an extra land drop for Omnath landfall. Saving fetches for Omnath turns is important for maximizing the landfall chain (4 life, then RGWU mana, then 4 damage).",
