    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Eldrazi Temple's second ability produces {C}{C} that can only be spent on colorless Eldrazi spells or abilities. Kozilek's Return is a colorless Instant (via Devoid) but does not have the Eldrazi subtype, so the restricted mana cannot be used to cast it. Choosing the restricted mana mode wastes potential value from the Temple.",
